asset:        Pretendard-SemiBold.otf
title:        Pretendard SemiBold (Korean and Latin text face)
author:       Kil Hyung-jin (orioncactus) and the Pretendard contributors
source:       https://github.com/orioncactus/pretendard (release v1.3.9, public/static)
license:      OFL-1.1
license-file: assets/fonts/OFL-Pretendard.txt
added:        2026-11-09 by Claude (agent) for Janghoon Lee
notes:        Unmodified font file, embedded via include_bytes! in the text engine so Korean captions and titles
              render in one designed face on every platform instead of a system fallback (a hairline Noto Sans KR Thin
              on a bare Linux host, a Chinese face elsewhere).
